{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-codex#card-zh","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-codex","commit":"cb7eec0a5d5106bad807dbc30e3989c1bb43637c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Codex Importer（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把本地 Codex 会话历史导入为新的 DSH 会话。它在 DSH 设置中加入 Codex 页面，通过宿主端扫描 Codex 会话 JSONL 文件并读取消息，再创建含导入对话的新会话。主要功能有选择默认或自定义会话目录、查看会话名称与时间、将选定会话导入并打开新会话。适合希望把本地 Codex 对话接续到 DSH 的用户。使用前需要 DSH 宿主能够读取本地 Codex 会话文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:191-222","src/index.ts:206-235"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-codex#card-en","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-codex","commit":"cb7eec0a5d5106bad807dbc30e3989c1bb43637c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Codex Importer (a Web plugin) brings local Codex conversations into DSH. Its settings page scans the default or a chosen directory and lists sessions. Select one to read its JSONL messages into a new DSH session, then open it. The host needs access to the local files.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:191-222","src/index.ts:206-235"]}
